    "https://www.buzzfeed.com/about/jobs?edition=us": {
      "title": "Join our team",
      "description": "Jobs at BuzzFeed About Press Jobs Contact Investors Legal Join our team At BuzzFeed Inc., we’ve created an environment where employees can bring their authentic selves to work while building tools and creating content that spreads joy and truth, and helps connect people across the globe. See Openings Diversity, Inclusion, and Belonging At BuzzFeed Inc., it's important to us that our employees reflect the diversity in the world around us and that we cultivate an environment where everyone feels empowered to be their authentic self. Much of the work being done to create this environment is through our Employee Resource Groups. Our ERGs lead company-wide events and engagements that help to cultivate an environment that enables all employees to show up authentically. Employee Resource Groups at BuzzFeed Inc. BuzzFeed Inc. currently has 6 ERGs with chapters in several BuzzFeed office locations. Our ERGs work hard to create affinity communities, celebrate heritage months and generate awareness around important issues impacting BuzzFeeders. Perks & Benefits As a BuzzFeed Inc. employee, you will enjoy perks like company-wide events, career development courses, and no work on your birthday! But most importantly, you’ll work alongside inspiring colleagues to build tools and create content that connects hundreds of millions of people and brings truth and joy to people all over the world. Come join us! Wellness Comprehensive benefits for medical, dental, and vision insurance with a focus on Wellness. Plus discounts on Gyms, Care.com , and access to resources like Maven, Headspace Care, and One Medical. Planning for the future Take advantage of the 401(k) plan with a company match, and supplemental life insurance options. Work-life balance We offer our employees paid time off (including your birthday!), paid holidays and generous leave options for life events such as becoming a parent or getting married. Career development Opportunities for personal and professional growth via work experience, offerings from our in-house Learning @ BuzzFeed team, our Employee Resource Groups, and more. Our Interview Process You’re about to embark on an adventure to join one of BuzzFeed Inc.’s dynamic teams. Here’s your roadmap to becoming part of our story: Workplace Awards BuzzFeed is a winner of Digiday's Work Life Award for Most Innovative Culture. In 2019, BuzzFeed was named one of the Best Places to Work for LGBTQ Equality by HRC’s Corporate Equality Index . People of BuzzFeed Find us on Instagram @peopleofbuzzfeed All job applications must be received through the official BuzzFeed Inc. Jobs board ( https://www.buzzfeed.com/about/jobs ), including referrals. It is BuzzFeed Inc.'s practice to not schedule job interviews until after an application is submitted through our jobs board. BuzzFeed Inc. is proud to be an equal opportunity workplace. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to, and will not be discriminated against based on age, race, gender, color, religion, national origin, sexual orientation, gender identity, veteran status, disability or any other protected category. EEO is the law"
    }
  },
